#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:5
#: 5a4210cbdd034e958cfc4f45ff9aee89
msgid "Requesting Data From The Autopilot"
msgstr "从自动驾驶仪请求数据"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:7
#: 06604dc33f744ff7a8971513a319403f
msgid ""
"The ground station or companion computer can request the data it wants (and "
"the rate) using one of the following methods:"
msgstr "地面站或伴随计算机可使用以下方法之一请求所需的数据（及其频率）："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:9
#: f50018879cb5422996bed41bf151572b
msgid ""
"Set the ``SRx_`` parameters to cause the autopilot to pro-actively send "
"groups of messages on start-up.  This method is easy to set-up for a small "
"number of drones but is not recommended for most applications"
msgstr "设置 ``SRx_`` 参数，使自动驾驶仪在启动时主动发送消息组。此方法对少量无人机来说易于设置，但不推荐用于大多数应用场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:10
#: 93653a37f9be4a92ae81afeebf9f77c9
msgid ""
"Send `REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ messages"
" to set the rate for groups of messages"
msgstr ""
"发送 `REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ "
"消息以设置消息组的发送频率"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:11
#: 56067b5b645e489ab5788b00cc1acd09
msgid ""
"Send a `SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__"
" command (within a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ message) to "
"precisely control the rate of an individual message.  Note this is only "
"supported on ArduPilot 4.0 and higher"
msgstr ""
"发送 `SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__"
" 命令（封装在 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ "
"消息中）以精确控制单条消息的发送频率。注意，此功能仅在 ArduPilot 4.0 及更高版本中支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:12
#: dcdc0d2e23c84c8fa74e3bab87b1b59d
msgid ""
"Send a `REQUEST_MESSAGE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_REQUEST_MESSAGE>`__ "
"command (within a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ message) to "
"request a single instance of a message.  Note this is only supported on "
"ArduPilot 4.0 and higher"
msgstr ""
"发送 `REQUEST_MESSAGE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_REQUEST_MESSAGE>`__ "
"命令（封装在 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ "
"消息中）以请求某条消息的单次实例。注意，此功能仅在 ArduPilot 4.0 及更高版本中支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:13
#: 1e71030b0394455297d99d7bab29360d
msgid ""
"Create configuration files stored on the SD card or in ROMFS specifying "
"message stream rates on a per-channel basis"
msgstr "创建存储在 SD 卡或 ROMFS 中的配置文件，按通道指定消息流速率"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:14
#: beb4cf721fb7494a80d4c926066248c6
msgid ""
"Install a Lua script to set individual messages rates (e.g. Set Message "
"Interval via a Lua script).  See \"Using a LUA Script\" section below."
msgstr "安装 Lua 脚本以设置单条消息的频率（如通过 Lua 脚本设置消息间隔）。请参阅下方 「使用 LUA 脚本」 章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:16
#: c2d13d6a676d40eda3c6ee7f75533f46
msgid ""
"Note that the stream rates will temporarily be 4 or more times slower than "
"requested while parameters and waypoints are being sent."
msgstr "注意，在发送参数和航点期间，流速率可能暂时比请求值慢 4 倍或更多。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:18
#: 0d197ccea725400c8fb17da14f1223a5
msgid "More details on the above methods can be found below."
msgstr "以上方法的更多详细信息见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:22
#: 8aec304a77bc47f5a9c7fce3da446db3
msgid ""
"If you find your message rates are reverting to some fixed value after you "
"set them, see the \"Rates Reverting to some Fixed value\" section at the "
"bottom of this page"
msgstr "若您发现消息频率在设置后恢复为某个固定值，请查阅本页底部的 「频率恢复为固定值」 章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:25
#: f7375d6e77914077a47d67f7e038c6de
msgid "Using SRx Parameters"
msgstr "使用 SRx 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:27
#: 6c69320f25894b44acbd0e21b3e6e986
msgid ""
"Setting the ``SRx_`` parameters (and then rebooting the autopilot) will "
"cause the autopilot to pro-actively send groups of messages to the ground "
"station.  This is not the recommended method because the ground station has "
"no way to determine what \"x\" should be."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``SRx_`` 参数（然后重启自动驾驶仪）将使自动驾驶仪主动向地面站发送消息组。不推荐此方法，因为地面站无法确定 「x」 应该是什么。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:29
#: a55b7d854f194d6dbc8d33c2d1a605e2
msgid "Connect to the autopilot with a ground station"
msgstr "通过地面站连接到自动驾驶仪"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:30
#: 18eee6b3f1cd4acabd6d3aa1e4347541
msgid ""
"Determine which telemetry connection is being used.  For example if the "
"ground station is connected to the autopilot's \"Telem1\" port (perhaps "
"using a wifi or telemetry radio) then the ``SR1_`` parameters should be "
"modified"
msgstr ""
"确定所使用的遥测连接。例如，若地面站连接到自动驾驶仪的 「Telem1」 端口（可能通过 Wi-Fi 或遥测电台），则应修改 ``SR1_`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:31
#: 64f176f118bf47faa449c859b23e77f6
msgid ""
"Set the ``SRx_`` parameter to the rate (in Hz) you wish the group of "
"messages to be sent.  The exact messages contained in each group can be "
"determined by inspecting the STREAM_xxx arrays in each vehicle's "
"GCS_Mavlink.cpp file (see here for `Copter "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L393>`__,"
" `Plane "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L547>`__,"
" `Rover "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L457>`__,"
" `Sub "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduSub/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L318>`__"
" and `AntennaTracker "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/AntennaTracker/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L232>`__)."
"  Below is the list of messages by group for Copter-4.0:"
msgstr ""
"将 ``SRx_`` 参数设置为所需消息组的发送频率（Hz）。每组中具体包含哪些消息，可通过查阅各飞行器 GCS_Mavlink.cpp 文件中的 "
"STREAM_xxx 数组来确定（参见 `Copter "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L393>`__、`Plane"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L547>`__、`Rover"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L457>`__、`Sub"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduSub/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L318>`__"
" 和 `AntennaTracker "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/AntennaTracker/GCS_Mavlink.cpp#L232>`__）。以下是"
" Copter-4.0 的消息分组列表："

