#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:176
#: 0694d3c4b053414488a8fe7de0c9ae6d
msgid ""
"If the telemetry link is shared (i.e. multiple GCSs or a GCS and a companion"
" computer) there can be conflicting requests.  The most common example is "
"the Mission Planner using the REQUEST_DATA_STREAM method while a companion "
"computer uses SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL method.  Mission Planner at least allows "
"turning off the REQUEST_DATA_STREAM requests by setting the rates to \"-1\" "
"(see :ref:`Setting the Datarate <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs-"
"setting-the-datarate>`).  MAVProxy users can ``set streamrate -1``."
msgstr ""
"若遥测链路被共享（如多个地面站，或地面站与伴随计算机同时使用），可能会产生冲突请求。最常见的情况是 Mission Planner 使用 "
"REQUEST_DATA_STREAM 方式而伴随计算机使用 SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL 方式。Mission Planner "
"至少支持通过将速率设置为 「-1」 来关闭 REQUEST_DATA_STREAM 请求（见 :ref:`设置数据速率 "
"<planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs-setting-the-datarate>`）。MAVProxy "
"用户可输入 ``set streamrate -1``。"

