msgstr "在基于 ChibiOS 的板卡（超过 1MB flash）上，将在 SD 卡根目录中搜索特定命名的文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:212
#: 3a9c68350a5142e0ad0c9ce54cfc8a7f
msgid ""
"Each mavlink channel is configured in a separate configuration file.  The "
"first serial port configured as mavlink is channel 0, the second serial port"
" channel 1 etc."
msgstr "每个 MAVLink 通道在单独的配置文件中配置。第一个配置为 MAVLink 的串口为通道 0，第二个为通道 1，以此类推。"

