msgid "An example filename is ``message-intervals-chan0.txt``"
msgstr "示例文件名为 ``message-intervals-chan0.txt``"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:216
#: c3132ceab9fb477daf5bc88308f2168d
msgid ""
"The format is simple but strict.  There are two columns, separated by a "
"single space and both containing numbers.  The first number is a mavlink "
"message ID.  The second is the message interval, in milliseconds.  Each line"
" must be terminated by either carriage-return *or* a line-feed."
msgstr ""
"格式简单但严格。共两列，以单个空格分隔，均为数字。第一列为 MAVLink 消息 ID，第二列为消息间隔（毫秒）。每行必须以回车 *或* 换行符结尾。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:224
#: caa857c895de483a8a6e35104b27d155
msgid ""
"This sample file content will stream `ATTITUDE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ATTITUDE>`__ (ID=30) at 20Hz and"
" `SCALED_PRESSURE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SCALED_PRESSURE>`__ (ID=29) at "
"5Hz.  Message ID 28 is RAW_PRESSURE which ArduPilot does not send - this "
"line will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"此示例文件内容将以 20Hz 频率流式发送 `ATTITUDE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ATTITUDE>`__（ID=30），以 5Hz 频率流式发送"
" `SCALED_PRESSURE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SCALED_PRESSURE>`__（ID=29）。消息 ID"
" 28 为 RAW_PRESSURE，ArduPilot 不发送该消息，此行将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-requesting-data.rst:226
